{"availability":"available","full":"Maatify/php-i18n","name":"php-i18n","description":"Database-driven internationalization library for structured translation keys, exact language scopes, governance, and MySQL persistence.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T18:33:04Z","updated":"2026-10-03T12:52:41Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/Maatify/php-i18n","topics":["composer","composer-package","i18n","internationalization","localization","maatify","maatify-dev","maatify-ecosystem","mysql","php","php-library","translation","translations"],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](README.md) [](composer.json) [](LICENSE) [](phpstan.neon)","maatify/php-i18n is a governed, database-driven translation layer for PHP: structured keys, exact-scope translation values in MySQL, fail-soft runtime reads, management reads for admin screens, and operational coverage facts. Language identity stays with the Host: I18n stores an exact, nullable language code and never applies a fallback.","Development / Unpublished — there is currently no supported distribution install. See Installation for repository-development setup."],"features":["Governed structured keys: a key is scope.domain.keypart and can only exist inside an active, assigned (scope, domain).","Exact language scopes: reads and writes address one exact languagecode (or NULL, the unlocalized scope). No fallback, default or wildcard inside I18n; fallback is Host policy.","Fail-soft reads, fail-hard writes: a runtime miss returns null or an empty DTO; a write violating governance throws a typed exception.","Synchronous derived state: per-domain, per-language summary and per-key counters are updated in the same transaction and are rebuildable.","Package-owned persistence: seven maai18n tables; no foreign key to, and no join with, any Host table."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maatify/php-i18n/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f0efd13f05f213f05b4efcb2514daa45ebc48b84c74bcfc30c6a8f416ef70b4a","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](README.md) [](composer.json) [](LICENSE) [](phpstan.neon)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maatify/php-i18n/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f0efd13f05f213f05b4efcb2514daa45ebc48b84c74bcfc30c6a8f416ef70b4a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maatify/php-i18n/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T12:52:41Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Maatify/php-i18n/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","hash":"f0efd13f05f213f05b4efcb2514daa45ebc48b84c74bcfc30c6a8f416ef70b4a","originalBytes":13195,"storedBytes":13195,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["composer","i18n","examples","package","check","php","consumer","reads","quality","home","maa","maatify","mysql","usage","dependencies","integration","never","repository","runtime","schema","verification","web","code","docs","exact","language","new","see","audit","gate","guides","host","installation","key","keys","null","state","translation","type","verify","changelog.md","command","database","derived","development","docker","every","getvalue","guide.md","keyid","license","management","optional","persistence","php-di","reference","requirements","schema.i18n.sql","scope","security.md","transaction","unit","value","workflow","writer-","writes","actionlint","adapter","any","autoload","available","book","boundaries","canonical","capability","create","criter